#! saves ending_79
# Ending variant 79 (route 1, after 克雷布特里 falls in stage 130): the "ending_79" fixture is
# the stage-131 turn-1 autosave from s2auto --set-flag 130:15, with story flag 4 set (the
# stage is over at once, as s2auto --set-flag 131:4) and flag 63 set, 64 and 65 cleared. The
# victory event sets ending flag 79, then the closing pages, that variant's epilogues, the
# record and the staff page. Inputs recorded by s2auto --oracle-check --record-only.
